<form action="/builder/pc/<%= pc.id %>/edit/social" method="POST" class="note-form">
	<!-- Appearance -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="appearance"> Appearance </label>
		<p>A single paragraph describing your characters physical appearance. This is public and is always visible.</p>
		<textarea id="appearance" name="appearance" rows="6"><%= pc?.social?.appearance || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Background -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="background"> Background </label>
		<p>A single paragraph describing your characters public background, or what the average person has heard about you,
			from before you joined the party. This is public and is visible immediately upon being introduced.</p>
		<textarea id="background" name="background" rows="8"><%= pc?.social?.background || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Associates -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="associates"> Associates (Optional)</label>
		<p>A list of publicly known associates, such as family, friends, colleagues, and enemies.</p>
		<textarea id="associates" name="associates" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.associates || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Rumors -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="rumors"> Rumors (Optional)</label>
		<p>A rumor or two that people may have heard about you.</p>
		<textarea id="rumors" name="rumors" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.rumors || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Aspirations -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="aspirations"> Aspirations (Min: 1, Max: 3)</label>
		<p>Clearly actionable goals of your character, which have an obvious and reachable end point.</p>
		<textarea id="aspirations" name="aspirations" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.aspirations || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Anathema / Phobias -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="anathema"> Anathema (Required: 1)</label>
		<p>One action that you cannot abide - you will never willingly do them or tolerate it happening. The antithesis of
			who you are and what you stand for.</p>
		<textarea id="anathema" name="anathema" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.anathema || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="phobias"> Phobias (Min: 1)</label>
		<p>At least one tangible fear your character possesses. When confronted with your fears, you may become shaken or
			frightened, or you may gain the power to overcome them.</p>
		<textarea id="phobias" name="phobias" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.phobias || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Quirks / Flaws -->
	<h3>Two Quirks and a Flaw!</h3>
	<p><em>When you choose an attribute or trait to use as a quirk or flaw, you can dig deeper into
			the concept by asking yourself how and why. If you're shy, how shy are you? So shy that you can never look anyone
			directly in the eye? If you're paranoid, why are you paranoid? Maybe everyone you've ever trusted betrayed you?
			Homing in on desires and fears will help answer those questions.</em></p>

	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="quirks"> Quirks (Min: 2)</label>
		<p>Quirks are specific attributes of your personality or psyche: character traits, compulsions, eccentricities, or
			uncommon physical features. These shouldn't be commonplace or mundane.
			<q>Tall</q> is a poor one, but <q>too big for my body</q> could be great.
			<q>Charismatic</q> is weak, but <q>flirts with nearly everybody I meet</q> is specific and actionable.
			<q>Homebody</q> is not as good a quirk as <q>feels tired, uncomfortable, and hungry away from home.</q>
		</p>
		<textarea id="quirks" name="quirks" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.quirks || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="flaws"> Flaws (Min: 1)</label>
		<p>Similar to quirks, flaws are the shortcomings that make your character real and should be considered in the
			same way.
			Instead of merely being <q>arrogant,</q> maybe you <q>believe you're smarter than anyone else you know.</q>
			Perhaps you're not so much <q>proud</q> as <q>afraid of being wrong and looking stupid.</q>
			Rather than <q>greedy,</q> you may be <q>terrified of dying poor and hungry.</q>
		</p>
		<textarea id="flaws" name="flaws" rows="4"><%= pc?.social?.flaws || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Secrets -->
	<div class="form-field">
		<label for="secrets"> Secrets (Optional)</label>
		<p>Making note of your characters secrets can help bring them to life. They may start with some serious ones, or
			they may not have any at all, but they should be recorded and managed here.</p>
		<textarea id="secrets" name="secrets" rows="6"><%= pc?.social?.secrets || '' %></textarea>
	</div>

	<!-- Formatting Buttons -->
	<div class="form-formatting">
		<button type="button" class="btn fmt-btn" data-tag="b"><b>Bold</b></button>
		<button type="button" class="btn fmt-btn" data-tag="i"><i>Italic</i></button>
		<button type="button" class="btn fmt-btn" data-tag="q"><b>Quote</b></button>
		<button type="button" class="btn fmt-btn" data-tag="sup">Sup</button>
		<button type="button" class="btn fmt-btn" data-tag="sub">Sub</button>
	</div>

	<!-- Actions -->
	<div class="form-actions">

		<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
			Save Social Profile and Continue
		</button>

		<a href="/builder/pc/<%= pc.id %>/edit?tab=main" class="btn fmt-btn">
			Back
		</a>

	</div>

</form>